# Replaces Semgrep's default ignore list (which silently skips any `test/`, `build/`, `dist/` …
# directory). Only what git ignores is skipped; the rules themselves exclude test-only code and the
# transport files explicitly (semgrep/ipc-sender-guard.yml). Scans run with --no-git-ignore so
# untracked new files are scanned too.
:include .gitignore
